<%- include('../common-new/header') %>

  <body>

    <%- include('../common-new/navbar') %>

      <section class="hero-section pb-5 new-header-padding-sec">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse align-items-center g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
              <img
                src="https://assets.clarisco.com/clarisco-images/blockchain/solutions/hyperledger-development/hyperledger-development-development.webp"
                alt="hyperledger-development-development" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">

              <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold lh-1 my-3">Best <span class="fc-b">Hyperledger Blockchain</span>
                Development Company</h1>
              <p>Clarisco Solutions, a leading Hyperledger Blockchain development company, is
                widely acclaimed for
                providing enterprise-grade Hyperledger Blockchain services and solutions across multiple industries.
                Our Blockchain experts create top-notch Hyperledger-powered, decentralized applications that enable
                secure and transparent transactions.</p>
              <div class="mt-5">
                <button data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#PopForm" class="nft-new-banner-button-1"
                  data-aos="fade-up">Get a Demo
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
        <div class="container">
          <h2 class="text-center mb-5">These are some of the Business Blockchain Frameworks currently hosted with
            Hyperledger</h2>
          <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-lg-3 g-4">
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Hyperledger Burrow</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">It allows the client to use a smart contract interpreter that
                    conforms only to the Ethereum Virtual Machine's (EVM) specifications.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Hyperledger Fabric</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Fabric is widely used to implement blockchain technology and as a
                    foundation for other blockchain applications or solutions.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Hyperledger Sawtooth</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Sawtooth, a blockchain platform that allows you to build, deploy
                    and run distributed ledgers is designed. These ledgers have been proven to be flexible and
                    scalable.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Hyperledger Indy</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Indy is a distributed ledger that provides components that allow
                    you to create and use decentralized digital identities.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Hyperledger Iroha</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Iroha is a framework that uses blockchain technology to integrate
                    infrastructure projects that require distributed ledger technology.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
        <div class="container">
          <h2 class="text-center mb-3">Hyperledger Features</h2>
          <p class="text-center mb-5">With us, you are assured that using Hyperledger, we can offer you
            the following features.</p>
          <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-lg-2 g-4">
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Plethora Of Network Platform</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">There are many network platforms, including Hyperledger Fabric and
                    Burrow, Iroha, Sawtooth, that can be used to support enterprises in accessing ledger data,
                    integrating applications to blockchains, and overseeing transactions.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Higher accuracy</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Hyperledger was built on an open-source platform that provides
                    higher accuracy and stability. This makes it less likely to make mistakes in transactions
                    occurring in the Blockchain.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Open-Source Security</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">The Linux Foundation created Hyperledger with the sole purpose of
                    creating open-source blockchain and related tools for maximum security and reliability.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">A trustworthy business model</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Hyperledger's open-source platform makes it easy for businesses to
                    reduce costs and complexity when it comes to legal restrictions involving Blockchains.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Transparency and Scalability</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Hyperledger provides distributed ledgers called Smart Contracts.
                    These contracts offer transparency and scalability in private business contracts.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
        <div class="container">
          <h2 class="text-center mb-5">FAQ(Frequently Asked Question)</h2>
          <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample">
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne"
                  aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                  What is Hyperledger technology?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Hyperledger, a global enterprise-level blockchain project, provides the framework, guidelines,
                  guidelines, and tools necessary to create open-source blockchains for various industries.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                  Which is better Hyperledger, or Ethereum?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Both Hyperledger (and Ethereum) are flexible in many ways, but they have their strengths. The
                  powerful smart contract engine of Ethereum makes it an open platform that can be used for virtually
                  any type of application. Hyperledger addresses privacy and performance issues through a permissioned
                  mode and fine-grained access controls.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                  What is Hyperledger cloud computing?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Hyperledger is an open-source project that supports the development of distributed ledgers based on
                  blockchain technology. Hyperledger is a collaborative effort to develop the necessary frameworks,
                  standards and tools to build and maintain blockchains and other related applications.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                  What's the difference between Hyperledger and Hyperledger Fabric?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Hyperledger Fabric only supports permissioned networks. Hyperledger Sawtooth supports a Distributed
                  Ledger Technology network (DLT), which can either be permissionless or permitted.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <%- include('../common-new/footer') %>

  </body>

  </html>